flowchart TD
  cmd[uigraph lens] --> resolve[Resolve PR or branches]
  resolve --> start_viewer[Start viewer if needed]
  start_viewer -->|POST api lens runs| handler[handleLensRequest]
  handler --> start_run[startLensRun]
  start_run --> source{Review source}
  source -->|github| token[Resolve GitHub token]
  token -->|fetchReview| github[GitHub]
  source -->|local| local_git[readLocalReview via git]
  github --> analyze[analyzeReview with agent]
  local_git --> analyze
  analyze -->|stage updates| subscribers[Run subscribers]
  analyze -->|saved runs| lens_data[~/.uigraph/lens]
  subscribers --> lens_page[Viewer Lens page]
  start_run -->|runId| cmd
